    SecretsData: []
    Narration: "<narrations><narration id = \"0\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\"
      title=\"nothing\"><title id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent
      = \"\"><languages><ca>FRIGATA. SEGLE XVIII</ca><en>FRIGATE. 18TH CENTURY</en><es>FRAGATA.
      SIGLO XVIII</es><fr>FR\xC9GATE. XVIIIe SI\xC8CLE</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en></en><es></es><fr></fr></audios></title><token
      id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Fa molts anys, els vaixells
      catalans van comen\xE7ar a navegar fins a Am\xE8rica per comerciar. Un dels
      vaixells m\xE9s utilitzats era la fragata: tenia tres grans pals i era forta
      i r\xE0pida!</ca><en>Many years ago, Catalan ships began sailing all the way
      to America to trade. One of the most commonly used ships was the frigate: it
      had three huge masts and was strong and fast! </en><es>Hace muchos a\xF1os,
      los barcos catalanes comenzaron a navegar hasta Am\xE9rica para comerciar.
      Uno de los barcos m\xE1s utilizados era la fragata: ten\xEDa tres grandes m\xE1stiles
      y era fuerte y r\xE1pida.</es><fr>Il y a de nombreuses ann\xE9es, des navires
      catalans commenc\xE8rent \xE0 naviguer jusqu\u2019en Am\xE9rique pour faire
      du commerce. L\u2019un des navires les plus couramment utilis\xE9s \xE9tait
      la fr\xE9gate : elle avait trois immenses m\xE2ts et elle \xE9tait solide et
      rapide !</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en>10.848</en><es>11.76</es><fr>12.36</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"1\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Podia navegar fins i tot
      quan el temps era molt dolent, amb tempestes i vents forts. Tot i que transportava
      mercaderies per vendre, la fragata tamb\xE9 portava canons, per si necessitava
      defensar-se d\u2019un atac.</ca><en>It could sail even when the weather was
      very bad, with storms and strong winds. Although it carried goods to sell,
      the frigate also carried cannons, in case it needed to defend itself from an
      attack.</en><es>Pod\xEDa navegar incluso cuando el clima era muy malo, con
      tormentas y vientos fuertes. Aunque llevaba mercanc\xEDas para vender, la fragata
      tambi\xE9n transportaba ca\xF1ones, por si necesitaba defenderse de un ataque.</es><fr>Il
      pouvait naviguer m\xEAme lorsque le temps \xE9tait tr\xE8s mauvais, avec des
      temp\xEAtes et de forts vents. Bien qu\u2019il transport\xE2t des marchandises
      \xE0 vendre, la fr\xE9gate transportait aussi des canons, au cas o\xF9 il aurait
      d\xFB se d\xE9fendre contre une attaque.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text for
      language (ca)</ca><en>10.8</en><es>11.88</es><fr>12.702</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"fragata-diana\" position = \"-2.145369,0.9580647,2.139347\" rotation
      = \"-0.1436369,-0.1802899,-0.02662294,0.9727051\" scale = \"3.465071,3.465071,3.465071\"
      type = \"Image\" animation = \"\"/></token><token id = \"2\" audioclip = \"\"
      startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\" destroy = \"True\" pause
      = \"False\"><languages><ca>Creuar tot l\u2019oce\xE0 Atl\xE0ntic va trigar
      aproximadament vint dies!</ca><en>Crossing the whole Atlantic Ocean took about
      twenty days!</en><es>Cruzar todo el oc\xE9ano Atl\xE1ntico tom\xF3 unos veinte
      d\xEDas.</es><fr>Traverser tout l\u2019oc\xE9an Atlantique a pris environ vingt
      jours !</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text for language (ca)</ca><en>3.12</en><es>3.288</es><fr>3.696</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"Sailors\" position = \"-4.232657,0.386981,0.1958793\" rotation = \"0.0007126026,0.9128387,0.001593105,-0.4083166\"
      scale = \"3.465916,3.465916,3.465916\" type = \"Video\" animation = \"\"/><asset
      name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-4.430959,-0.4334737,0.8326714\" rotation
      = \"0.1156575,-0.8128347,0.1727735,0.5441253\" scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\" type
      = \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/></token></narration><narration id = \"1\"
      startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" title=\"nothing\"><title id = \"0\" audioclip
      = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\"><languages><ca>COMPANYIA REIAL DE
      COMER\xC7</ca><en>ROYAL TRADE COMPANY</en><es>COMPA\xD1\xCDA REAL DE COMERCIO</es><fr>COMPAGNIE
      DE COMMERCE ROYALE</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en></en><es></es><fr></fr></audios></title><token
      id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>El 1755, un grup de comerciants
      de Barcelona va crear una empresa perqu\xE8 poguessin vendre els seus productes
      a Am\xE8rica.</ca><en>In 1755, a group of merchants from Barcelona created
      a company so they could sell their products in America. </en><es>En 1755, un
      grupo de comerciantes de Barcelona cre\xF3 una compa\xF1\xEDa para que pudieran
      vender sus productos en Am\xE9rica.</es><fr>En 1755, un groupe de commer\xE7ants
      de Barcelone a cr\xE9\xE9 une soci\xE9t\xE9 afin de pouvoir vendre leurs produits
      en Am\xE9rique.</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en>6.624</en><es>7.392</es><fr>7.704</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"1\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"True\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Va ser el primer pas cap
      a l\u2019intercanvi comercial dels catalans amb les col\xF2nies americanes.</ca><en>It
      was the first step toward Catalans trading with the American colonies. </en><es>Fue
      el primer paso hacia el comercio de los catalanes con las colonias americanas.</es><fr>C\u2019\xE9tait
      la premi\xE8re \xE9tape vers le commerce des Catalans avec les colonies am\xE9ricaines.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text
      for language (ca)</ca><en>3.744</en><es>4.488</es><fr>4.968</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-3.994362,-0.407885,-0.2911673\" rotation
      = \"0.05846124,0.93726,-0.1923922,0.2848005\" scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\" type
      = \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/><asset name = \"Merchant_01\" position =
      \"-3.799939,0.1431945,-0.05962888\" rotation = \"0.04244579,0.6971675,-0.04141897,0.714451\"
      scale = \"0.4616898,0.4616898,0.4616898\" type = \"Model3D\" animation = \"Clapping\"/><asset
      name = \"Merchant_02\" position = \"-4.761916,0.2056907,-0.7554705\" rotation
      = \"-0.01993675,0.8885857,-0.03879602,-0.4566321\" scale = \"0.460083,0.460083,0.460083\"
      type = \"Model3D\" animation = \"Talking\"/><asset name = \"Puerto_BCN\" position
      = \"-3.685766,0.5612682,-1.005878\" rotation = \"-0.01484555,0.9439629,0.04286578,0.3269193\"
      scale = \"3.464185,3.464185,3.464185\" type = \"Image\" animation = \"\"/></token><token
      id = \"2\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Per\xF2 anys m\xE9s tard,
      el 1778, es van permetre que moltes m\xE9s ciutats comerciessin amb Am\xE8rica,
      de manera que aquesta companyia va esdevenir menys important i finalment va
      desapar\xE8ixer entre el 1784 i el 1785.</ca><en>But years later, in 1778,
      many more cities were allowed to trade with America, so this company became
      less important and eventually disappeared between 1784 and 1785.</en><es>Pero
      a\xF1os m\xE1s tarde, en 1778, se permiti\xF3 que muchas m\xE1s ciudades comerciaran
      con Am\xE9rica, por lo que esta compa\xF1\xEDa se volvi\xF3 menos importante
      y finalmente desapareci\xF3 entre 1784 y 1785.</es><fr>Mais des ann\xE9es plus
      tard, en 1778, de nombreuses autres villes furent autoris\xE9es \xE0 commercer
      avec l\u2019Am\xE9rique, de sorte que cette compagnie perdit de son importance
      et finit par dispara\xEEtre entre 1784 et 1785.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text
      for language (ca)</ca><en>13.08</en><es>14.736</es><fr>14.88</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-5.267457,-0.1511134,0.3297474\" rotation
      = \"0.08467834,-0.7679874,0.1038362,0.626293\" scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\" type
      = \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/></token></narration><narration id = \"2\"
      startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" title=\"nothing\"><title id = \"0\" audioclip
      = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\"><languages><ca>MOLTES FEINES AL CAMP</ca><en>MANY
      JOBS IN THE COUNTRYSIDE</en><es>MUCHOS TRABAJOS EN EL CAMPO</es><fr>BEAUCOUP
      D\u2019EMPLOIS \xC0 LA CAMPAGNE</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en></en><es></es><fr></fr></audios></title><token
      id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Fa segles, les fam\xEDlies
      que vivien al camp no nom\xE9s conreaven la terra: tamb\xE9 feien altres feines
      per guanyar una mica m\xE9s de diners.</ca><en>Centuries ago, families who
      lived in the countryside didn't just farm the land \u2014 they also did other
      jobs to earn a bit more money.</en><es>Hace siglos, las familias que viv\xEDan
      en el campo no solo cultivaban la tierra: tambi\xE9n realizaban otros trabajos
      para ganar un poco m\xE1s de dinero.</es><fr>Il y a des si\xE8cles, les familles
      qui vivaient \xE0 la campagne ne se contentaient pas de cultiver la terre :
      elles faisaient aussi d\u2019autres m\xE9tiers pour gagner un peu plus d\u2019argent.</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en>8.16</en><es>8.712</es><fr>8.688</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"1\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"True\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Aix\xF2 va passar arreu
      de Catalunya, a la costa, a les muntanyes i a l\u2019interior!</ca><en>This
      happened all over Catalonia, on the coast, in the mountains, and inland!</en><es>Esto
      ocurri\xF3 en toda Catalu\xF1a, en la costa, en las monta\xF1as y en el interior.</es><fr>Cela
      s\u2019est produit partout en Catalogne, sur la c\xF4te, dans les montagnes
      et \xE0 l\u2019int\xE9rieur des terres !</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text for
      language (ca)</ca><en>5.136</en><es>5.04</es><fr>5.28</fr></audios><asset name
      = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-4.263365,-0.4014624,4.651375\" rotation = \"0.1991126,-0.04958423,0.01008803,0.9786694\"
      scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\" type = \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/><asset name
      = \"Female_InnKeeper\" position = \"-5.233727,0.05334866,4.142004\" rotation
      = \"-0.03997273,0.8699984,-0.07152679,-0.4861984\" scale = \"0.1799668,0.1799668,0.1799668\"
      type = \"Model3D\" animation = \"Pick\"/><asset name = \"Male_Cook\" position
      = \"-5.092413,0.01209795,4.451898\" rotation = \"0.09223511,-0.05388078,0.004998362,0.9942659\"
      scale = \"0.1728168,0.1728168,0.1728168\" type = \"Model3D\" animation = \"Pointing\"/></token><token
      id = \"2\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>I les dones van tenir
      un paper molt important en totes aquestes feines extra.</ca><en>And women played
      a very important role in all these extra jobs.</en><es>Y las mujeres desempe\xF1aron
      un papel muy importante en todos estos trabajos adicionales.</es><fr>Et les
      femmes ont jou\xE9 un r\xF4le tr\xE8s important dans tous ces emplois suppl\xE9mentaires.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text
      for language (ca)</ca><en>4.152</en><es>4.593</es><fr>4.464</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-5.433833,-0.6560527,4.058645\" rotation =
      \"0.2542666,-0.3135939,0.08755687,0.9106817\" scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\" type
      = \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/></token></narration><narration id = \"3\"
      startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" title=\"nothing\"><title id = \"0\" audioclip
      = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\"><languages><ca>OCI AL CAMP</ca><en>LEISURE
      IN THE COUNTRYSIDE</en><es>OCIO EN EL CAMPO</es><fr>LOISIRS \xC0 LA CAMPAGNE</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en></en><es></es><fr></fr></audios></title><token
      id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Als pobles, la gent celebrava
      festes molt especials, amb missa, menjar i ball. Cada poble tenia la seva festa
      principal, amb m\xFAsica i balls que venien de l\u2019Edat Mitjana, com el
      \xABball de l\u2019almorratxa\xBB!</ca><en>In the villages, people celebrated
      very special festivals, with mass, food, and dancing. Each village had its
      own main festival, with music and dances that came from the Middle Ages, like
      the \xABball de l'almorratxa\xBB!</en><es>En los pueblos, la gente celebraba
      festivales muy especiales, con misa, comida y baile. Cada pueblo ten\xEDa su
      propia fiesta principal, con m\xFAsica y danzas que proven\xEDan de la Edad
      Media, \xA1como el \xABball de l'almorratxa\xBB!</es><fr>Dans les villages,
      les gens c\xE9l\xE9braient des f\xEAtes tr\xE8s sp\xE9ciales, avec la messe,
      la nourriture et de la danse. Chaque village avait sa f\xEAte principale, avec
      de la musique et des danses venues du Moyen \xC2ge, comme le \xAB ball de l\u2019almorratxa
      \xBB !</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en>12.048</en><es>13.68</es><fr>12.72</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"1\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Tamb\xE9 hi havia processons,
      jocs i m\xE9s balls durant les festes religioses.</ca><en>There were also processions,
      games, and more dances during religious festivals. </en><es>Tambi\xE9n hubo
      procesiones, juegos y m\xE1s bailes durante las festividades religiosas.</es><fr>Il
      y avait aussi des processions, des jeux et davantage de danses lors des f\xEAtes
      religieuses.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text for language (ca)</ca><en>4.8</en><es>5.184</es><fr>5.352</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"sardana_0\" position = \"-3.58951,0.5473566,11.35891\" rotation =
      \"-0.04146817,-0.1390717,-0.005828853,0.9893966\" scale = \"3.466411,3.466411,3.466411\"
      type = \"Image\" animation = \"\"/><asset name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-2.563774,-0.2380332,10.66762\"
      rotation = \"0.1532945,0.1968939,-0.0311849,0.9678642\" scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\"
      type = \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/></token><token id = \"2\" audioclip
      = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\" destroy = \"False\"
      pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>A Esplugues, per exemple, van celebrar una
      festa anomenada \xABRoser de Maig\xBB, molt estimada per la gent del camp!</ca><en>In
      Esplugues, for example, they celebrated a festival called \xABRoser de Maig\xBB,
      much loved by people in the countryside!</en><es>En Esplugues, por ejemplo,
      celebraron un festival llamado \xABRoser de Maig\xBB, \xA1muy querido por la
      gente del campo!</es><fr>\xC0 Esplugues, par exemple, ils ont c\xE9l\xE9br\xE9
      une f\xEAte appel\xE9e \xABRoser de Maig\xBB, tr\xE8s aim\xE9e par les habitants
      de la campagne !</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text for language (ca)</ca><en>7.92</en><es>6.552</es><fr>7.056</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-4.487181,-0.3950307,10.33313\" rotation =
      \"0.185853,-0.3336888,0.06728344,0.9217285\" scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\" type =
      \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/></token></narration><narration id = \"4\" startEvent
      = \"\" endEvent = \"\" title=\"nothing\"><title id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\"
      startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\"><languages><ca>D\xC9U, P\xC0TRIA, REI I LLEIS</ca><en>GOD,
      HOMELAND, KING, AND LAWS</en><es>DIOS, PATRIA, REY Y LEYES</es><fr>Dieu, Patrie,
      Roi et Lois</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en></en><es></es><fr></fr></audios></title><token
      id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Quan el rei Ferran VII
      va morir, hi va haver una gran baralla sobre qui havia de ser el nou rei.</ca><en>When
      King Ferdinand VII died, there was a big fight over who should be the new king.</en><es>Cuando
      el rey Fernando VII muri\xF3, hubo una gran pelea sobre qui\xE9n deb\xEDa ser
      el nuevo rey.</es><fr>Quand le roi Ferdinand VII est mort, il y a eu une grande
      lutte pour savoir qui devrait \xEAtre le nouveau roi.</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en>4.584</en><es>6.178</es><fr>6.12</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"1\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"True\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Algunes persones donaven
      suport al seu germ\xE0 Carlos, i d\u2019altres donaven suport a la seva filla
      Isabel. Cada b\xE0ndol pensava que tenia ra\xF3!</ca><en>Some people supported
      his brother Carlos, and others supported his daughter Isabel. Each side thought
      they were right! </en><es>Algunas personas apoyaron a su hermano Carlos, y
      otras apoyaron a su hija Isabel. Cada bando pens\xF3 que ten\xEDa raz\xF3n.</es><fr>Certaines
      personnes soutenaient son fr\xE8re Carlos, et d\u2019autres soutenaient sa
      fille Isabel. Chaque camp pensait avoir raison !</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text
      for language (ca)</ca><en>6.84</en><es>7.224</es><fr>6.792</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-4.416575,-0.4841708,11.53008\" rotation =
      \"-0.01506106,0.9728935,-0.2210358,-0.06629154\" scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\" type
      = \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/><asset name = \"Armorer\" position = \"-4.77178,0.2544195,12.18925\"
      rotation = \"0.0002204507,0.999482,-0.03140988,0.00701488\" scale = \"0.4612011,0.4612011,0.4612011\"
      type = \"Model3D\" animation = \"Cheering\"/><asset name = \"Executioner\"
      position = \"-5.03869,0.2753285,13.42961\" rotation = \"0.02601866,-0.109741,0.002873661,0.9936154\"
      scale = \"0.4597966,0.4597966,0.4597966\" type = \"Model3D\" animation = \"Pointing\"/></token><token
      id = \"2\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Aquest conflicte va provocar
      tres guerres durant el segle XIX, entre persones que no podien posar-se d\u2019acord
      sobre com s\u2019havia de governar el pa\xEDs.</ca><en>This dispute caused
      three wars during the 19th century, between people who couldn't agree on how
      the country should be governed.</en><es>Esta disputa caus\xF3 tres guerras
      durante el siglo XIX, entre personas que no pod\xEDan ponerse de acuerdo sobre
      c\xF3mo deb\xEDa gobernarse el pa\xEDs.</es><fr>Ce diff\xE9rend a provoqu\xE9
      trois guerres au cours du XIXe si\xE8cle, entre des personnes qui n\u2019arrivaient
      pas \xE0 s\u2019entendre sur la mani\xE8re dont le pays devait \xEAtre gouvern\xE9.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text
      for language (ca)</ca><en>6.72</en><es>7.824</es><fr>9.696</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-4.979474,-0.3950311,14.26083\" rotation =
      \"0.1960099,-0.1262986,0.02546627,0.972101\" scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\" type =
      \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/></token></narration><narration id = \"5\" startEvent
      = \"\" endEvent = \"\" title=\"nothing\"><title id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\"
      startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\"><languages><ca>LA F\xC0BRICA T\xC8XTIL</ca><en>THE
      TEXTILE FACTORY</en><es>LA F\xC1BRICA TEXTIL</es><fr>L\u2019USINE TEXTILE</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en></en><es></es><fr></fr></audios></title><token
      id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Fa molts anys, treballar
      en una f\xE0brica t\xE8xtil era molt dif\xEDcil. La gent treballava tantes
      hores al dia \u2014 12 o 13! \u2014 i guanyava molt pocs diners.</ca><en>Many
      years ago, working in a textile factory was very hard. People worked so many
      hours a day \u2014 12 or 13! \u2014 and earned very little money.</en><es>Hace
      muchos a\xF1os, trabajar en una f\xE1brica textil era muy duro. La gente trabajaba
      tantas horas al d\xEDa \u2014 \xA112 o 13! \u2014 y ganaba muy poco dinero.</es><fr>Il
      y a de nombreuses ann\xE9es, travailler dans une usine textile \xE9tait tr\xE8s
      difficile. Les gens travaillaient autant d\u2019heures par jour \u2014 12 ou
      13 ! \u2014 et gagnaient tr\xE8s peu d\u2019argent.</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en>10.8</en><es>9.792</es><fr>9.312</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"1\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Les f\xE0briques eren
      sorolloses, caloroses i poc netes. Fins i tot els nens petits havien de treballar!</ca><en>Factories
      were noisy, hot, and not very clean places. Even young children had to work!</en><es>Las
      f\xE1bricas eran ruidosas, calurosas y no muy limpias. \xA1Incluso los ni\xF1os
      peque\xF1os ten\xEDan que trabajar!</es><fr>Les usines \xE9taient bruyantes,
      chaudes et pas tr\xE8s propres. M\xEAme de jeunes enfants devaient travailler
      !</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text for language (ca)</ca><en>5.28</en><es>6.96</es><fr>5.64</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"fabricatextilcatalana\" position = \"4.544747,0.05334881,11.53622\"
      rotation = \"0.05598925,0.7276738,-0.05982555,0.6810117\" scale = \"3.466674,3.466674,3.466674\"
      type = \"Image\" animation = \"\"/><asset name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"4.273828,-0.4841712,9.688631\"
      rotation = \"0.08084738,0.9079021,-0.2062702,0.3558512\" scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\"
      type = \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/></token><token id = \"2\" audioclip
      = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\" destroy = \"False\"
      pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Les dones treballaven dur, per\xF2 guanyaven
      menys que els homes per la mateixa feina. I si alg\xFA es posava malalt o es
      feia mal, ning\xFA l\u2019ajudava.</ca><en>Women worked hard, but earned less
      than men for the same job. And if someone got sick or hurt, no one helped them.</en><es>Las
      mujeres trabajaron duro, pero ganaron menos que los hombres por el mismo trabajo.
      Y si alguien se enfermaba o se lastimaba, nadie les ayudaba.</es><fr>Les femmes
      travaillaient dur, mais gagnaient moins que les hommes pour le m\xEAme travail.
      Et si quelqu\u2019un tombait malade ou se blessait, personne ne l\u2019aidait.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text
      for language (ca)</ca><en>7.608</en><es>9.24</es><fr>7.656</fr></audios></token></narration><narration
      id = \"6\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" title=\"nothing\"><title id =
      \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\"><languages><ca>LA
      TAULA DE COT\xD3 IMPRESA</ca><en>THE PRINTED COTTON TABLE</en><es>LA MESA DE
      ALGOD\xD3N IMPRESA</es><fr>LA TABLE EN COTON IMPRIM\xC9</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en></en><es></es><fr></fr></audios></title><token
      id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>A les f\xE0briques on
      es confeccionaven teixits estampats de colors, anomenats \xABindianes\xBB,
      hi treballaven moltes persones.</ca><en>In the factories where colorful printed
      fabrics, called \"indianas,\" were made, many people worked. </en><es>En las
      f\xE1bricas donde se produc\xEDan telas estampadas de colores, llamadas \xABindianas\xBB,
      trabajaba mucha gente.</es><fr>Dans les usines o\xF9 l\u2019on fabriquait des
      tissus imprim\xE9s aux couleurs vives, appel\xE9s \xAB indiennes \xBB, de nombreuses
      personnes travaillaient.</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en>6.24</en><es>5.784</es><fr>6.552</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"1\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"True\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>La majoria eren homes,
      per\xF2 tamb\xE9 hi havia moltes dones i nens. Els nens ajudaven estirant el
      teixit sobre les taules i remenant la pintura en cubells.</ca><en>Most were
      men, but there were also many women and children. Children helped by stretching
      the fabric on tables and stirring the paint in buckets. </en><es>La mayor\xEDa
      eran hombres, pero tambi\xE9n hab\xEDa muchas mujeres y ni\xF1os. Los ni\xF1os
      ayudaban estirando la tela sobre las mesas y removiendo la pintura en cubos.</es><fr>La
      plupart \xE9taient des hommes, mais il y avait aussi de nombreuses femmes et
      des enfants. Les enfants aidaient en \xE9tendant le tissu sur des tables et
      en remuant la peinture dans des seaux.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text for
      language (ca)</ca><en>7.704</en><es>9.408</es><fr>9.312</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"2\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"True\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Amb els pocs diners que
      guanyaven, les fam\xEDlies podien pagar el lloguer d\u2019una petita casa.</ca><en>With
      the little money they earned, families could pay the rent for a small house.</en><es>Con
      el poco dinero que ganaban, las familias pod\xEDan pagar el alquiler de una
      casa peque\xF1a.</es><fr>Avec le peu d\u2019argent qu\u2019ils gagnaient, les
      familles pouvaient payer le loyer d\u2019une petite maison.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text
      for language (ca)</ca><en>3.936</en><es>5.184</es><fr>4.632</fr></audios></token></narration><narration
      id = \"7\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" title=\"nothing\"><title id =
      \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\"><languages><ca>Titol</ca><en>WINE
      PRESS</en><es>Titulo</es><fr>Titre</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en></en><es></es><fr></fr></audios></title><token
      id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Al segle XVIII, es van
      plantar enormes quantitats de vinyes a Catalunya, fins i tot als vessants m\xE9s
      dif\xEDcils de les muntanyes! Per fer vi, la gent feia servir m\xE0quines molt
      antigues, semblants a les que feien servir els romans fa molt, molt de temps.
      Una d\u2019elles era una premsa de fusta gegant.</ca><en>In the 18th century,
      huge numbers of vineyards were planted in Catalonia, even on the hardest mountain
      slopes! To make wine, people used very old machines, similar to the ones the
      Romans used long, long ago. One of them was a giant wooden press.</en><es>En
      el siglo XVIII, se plantaron enormes cantidades de vi\xF1edos en Catalu\xF1a,
      incluso en las laderas de monta\xF1a m\xE1s dif\xEDciles. Para hacer vino,
      la gente utilizaba m\xE1quinas muy antiguas, similares a las que usaban los
      romanos hace much\xEDsimo tiempo. Una de ellas era una enorme prensa de madera.</es><fr>Au
      XVIIIe si\xE8cle, d\u2019immenses quantit\xE9s de vignobles ont \xE9t\xE9 plant\xE9es
      en Catalogne, m\xEAme sur les pentes de montagne les plus difficiles ! Pour
      faire du vin, les gens utilisaient des machines tr\xE8s anciennes, semblables
      \xE0 celles que les Romains utilisaient il y a tr\xE8s, tr\xE8s longtemps.
      L\u2019une d\u2019elles \xE9tait une \xE9norme presse en bois</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en>15.416</en><es>17.216</es><fr>16.2</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"1\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"True\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Una altra, anomenada premsa
      de corda, feia servir una corda molt gruixuda i dos cargols gegants per espr\xE9mer
      els ra\xEFms i extreure\u2019n el suc.</ca><en>Another one, called a rope press,
      used a very thick rope and two giant screws to squeeze the grapes and get the
      juice out. </en><es>Otra, llamada prensa de cuerda, usaba una cuerda muy gruesa
      y dos tornillos gigantes para exprimir las uvas y extraer el jugo.</es><fr>Un
      autre, appel\xE9 une presse \xE0 corde, utilisait une corde tr\xE8s \xE9paisse
      et deux \xE9normes vis pour presser les raisins et en extraire le jus.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text
      for language (ca)</ca><en>6.394</en><es>8.52</es><fr>8.016</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"prensavino\" position = \"1.749392,0.20569,0.9562617\" rotation =
      \"0.03073715,0.7088571,-0.03094912,0.7040021\" scale = \"3.466406,3.466406,3.466406\"
      type = \"Image\" animation = \"\"/><asset name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"1.244606,-0.6620179,-0.3992128\"
      rotation = \"0.05350178,0.9436878,-0.2652583,0.1903389\" scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\"
      type = \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/></token><token id = \"2\" audioclip
      = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\" destroy = \"False\"
      pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Tot i que semblava molt pesat, en realitat
      es podia moure d\u2019un lloc a un altre!</ca><en>Even though it looked very
      heavy, it could actually be moved from one place to another!</en><es>Aunque
      parec\xEDa muy pesado, \xA1en realidad pod\xEDa moverse de un lugar a otro!</es><fr>M\xEAme
      si cela semblait tr\xE8s lourd, on pouvait en r\xE9alit\xE9 le d\xE9placer
      d\u2019un endroit \xE0 un autre !</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text for language
      (ca)</ca><en>4.632</en><es>4.2</es><fr>4.8</fr></audios></token></narration></narrations>"
