    SecretsData: []
    Narration: "<narrations><narration id = \"0\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\"
      title=\"nothing\"><title id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent
      = \"\"><languages><ca>FRIGATA. SEGLE XVIII</ca><en>FRIGATE. 18TH CENTURY</en><es>FRAGATA.
      SIGLO XVIII</es><fr>FR\xC9GATE. XVIIIe SI\xC8CLE</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en></en><es></es><fr></fr></audios></title><token
      id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>L\u2019oportunitat de
      comerciar obertament i directament amb Am\xE8rica impulsa la construcci\xF3
      naval a Catalunya durant el segle XVIII. Els catalans solen utilitzar vaixells
      petits per als viatges cap a les col\xF2nies: fragates, brigs i goletes.</ca><en>The
      opportunity to trade openly and directly with America energizes shipbuilding
      in Catalonia during the 18th century. Catalans typically use small ships for
      voyages to the colonies: frigates, brigs, and schooners. </en><es>La oportunidad
      de comerciar abiertamente y de forma directa con Am\xE9rica impulsa la construcci\xF3n
      naval en Catalu\xF1a durante el siglo XVIII. Los catalanes suelen utilizar
      barcos peque\xF1os para los viajes a las colonias: fragatas, bergantines y
      goletas.</es><fr>L\u2019opportunit\xE9 de commercer ouvertement et directement
      avec l\u2019Am\xE9rique stimule la construction navale en Catalogne au cours
      du XVIIIe si\xE8cle. Les Catalans utilisent g\xE9n\xE9ralement de petits navires
      pour leurs voyages vers les colonies : des fr\xE9gates, des bricks et des schooners.</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en>13.848</en><es>14.616</es><fr>15.312</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"1\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>La fragata, un vaixell
      de tres pals, s\xF2lid i r\xE0pid, \xE9s capa\xE7 de navegar en les condicions
      meteorol\xF2giques m\xE9s adverses. Tot i estar dedicada al comer\xE7, aquests
      vaixells naveguen armats perqu\xE8 puguin defensar-se en cas d\u2019un atac,
      o b\xE9 passar de l\u2019activitat comercial a la pirateria privada en temps
      de guerra.</ca><en>The frigate, a three-masted vessel, sturdy and fast, is
      capable of sailing in the most adverse weather conditions. Although engaged
      in trade, these ships sail armed so they can defend themselves in the event
      of an attack, or shift from commercial activity to privateering in times of
      war. </en><es>La fragata, una embarcaci\xF3n de tres m\xE1stiles, robusta y
      r\xE1pida, es capaz de navegar en las condiciones meteorol\xF3gicas m\xE1s
      adversas. Aunque se dedicaban al comercio, estos barcos navegaban armados para
      poder defenderse en caso de un ataque, o pasar de la actividad comercial al
      corso en tiempos de guerra.</es><fr>La fr\xE9gate, un navire \xE0 trois m\xE2ts,
      robuste et rapide, est capable de naviguer dans les conditions m\xE9t\xE9orologiques
      les plus d\xE9favorables. Bien qu\u2019elles soient engag\xE9es dans le commerce,
      ces navires naviguent arm\xE9s afin de pouvoir se d\xE9fendre en cas d\u2019attaque,
      ou passer de l\u2019activit\xE9 commerciale \xE0 la course en temps de guerre.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text
      for language (ca)</ca><en>17.088</en><es>16.978</es><fr>16.968</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"fragata-diana\" position = \"-2.145369,0.9580647,2.139347\" rotation
      = \"-0.1436369,-0.1802899,-0.02662294,0.9727051\" scale = \"3.465071,3.465071,3.465071\"
      type = \"Image\" animation = \"\"/></token><token id = \"2\" audioclip = \"\"
      startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\" destroy = \"True\" pause
      = \"False\"><languages><ca>La travessia de l\u2019Atl\xE0ntic solia durar al
      voltant de vint dies.</ca><en>The crossing of the Atlantic usually took around
      twenty days.</en><es>El cruce del Atl\xE1ntico normalmente tomaba alrededor
      de veinte d\xEDas.</es><fr>La travers\xE9e de l\u2019Atlantique prenait g\xE9n\xE9ralement
      une vingtaine de jours.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text for language (ca)</ca><en>3.192</en><es>3.874</es><fr>4.104</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"Sailors\" position = \"-4.232657,0.386981,0.1958793\" rotation = \"0.0007126026,0.9128387,0.001593105,-0.4083166\"
      scale = \"3.465916,3.465916,3.465916\" type = \"Video\" animation = \"\"/><asset
