      = \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/></token></narration><narration id = \"1\"
      startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" title=\"nothing\"><title id = \"0\" audioclip
      = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\"><languages><ca>COMPANYIA REIAL DE
      COMER\xC7</ca><en>ROYAL TRADE COMPANY</en><es>COMPA\xD1\xCDA REAL DE COMERCIO</es><fr>COMPAGNIE
      DE COMMERCE ROYALE</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en></en><es></es><fr></fr></audios></title><token
      id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Fundada a Barcelona el
      1755 per iniciativa d\u2019un grup de comerciants locals, aquesta empresa obre
      el cam\xED al comer\xE7 catal\xE0 amb Am\xE8rica, tot i les restriccions considerables.</ca><en>Founded
      in Barcelona in 1755 on the initiative of a group of local merchants, this
      company opens the way for Catalan trade with America, despite considerable
      restrictions. </en><es>Fundada en Barcelona en 1755 por iniciativa de un grupo
      de comerciantes locales, esta empresa abre el camino al comercio catal\xE1n
      con Am\xE9rica, a pesar de considerables restricciones.</es><fr>Fond\xE9e \xE0
      Barcelone en 1755 \xE0 l\u2019initiative d\u2019un groupe de commer\xE7ants
      locaux, cette entreprise ouvre la voie au commerce catalan avec l\u2019Am\xE9rique,
      malgr\xE9 des restrictions consid\xE9rables.</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en>10.608</en><es>11.544</es><fr>10.632</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"1\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"True\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Cau en decad\xE8ncia despr\xE9s
      de la concessi\xF3 del lliure comer\xE7 amb Am\xE8rica el 1778.</ca><en>It
      falls into decline following the granting of free trade with America in 1778.
      </en><es>Sufre una decadencia tras la concesi\xF3n del libre comercio con Am\xE9rica
      en 1778.</es><fr>Il d\xE9cline apr\xE8s l\u2019octroi du libre-\xE9change avec
      l\u2019Am\xE9rique en 1778.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text for language (ca)</ca><en>4.8</en><es>6.288</es><fr>4.968</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-3.994362,-0.407885,-0.2911673\" rotation
