      startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" title=\"nothing\"><title id = \"0\" audioclip
      = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\"><languages><ca>MOLTES FEINES AL CAMP</ca><en>MANY
      JOBS IN THE COUNTRYSIDE</en><es>MUCHOS TRABAJOS EN EL CAMPO</es><fr>BEAUCOUP
      D\u2019EMPLOIS \xC0 LA CAMPAGNE</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en></en><es></es><fr></fr></audios></title><token
      id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Al llarg del per\xEDode
      de l\u2019Edat Moderna, les fam\xEDlies pageses catalanes no vivien nom\xE9s
      de l\u2019agricultura. Segons la regi\xF3, complementaven els seus ingressos
      amb altres activitats: algunes zones s\u2019especialitzaven en determinats
      productes, mentre que d\u2019altres feien petits oficis o serveis.</ca><en>Throughout
      the Early Modern period, Catalan peasant families did not live off farming
      alone. Depending on the region, they supplemented their income with other activities:
      some areas specialized in particular products, others in small trades or services.</en><es>A
      lo largo del per\xEDodo de la Edad Moderna Temprana, las familias campesinas
      catalanas no viv\xEDan solo de la agricultura. Dependiendo de la regi\xF3n,
      complementaban sus ingresos con otras actividades: algunas zonas se especializaban
      en productos concretos, mientras que otras lo hac\xEDan en peque\xF1os oficios
      o servicios.</es><fr>Tout au long de la p\xE9riode moderne, les familles paysannes
      catalanes ne vivaient pas uniquement de l\u2019agriculture. Selon la r\xE9gion,
      elles compl\xE9taient leurs revenus par d\u2019autres activit\xE9s : certaines
      zones se sp\xE9cialisaient dans des produits particuliers, tandis que d\u2019autres
      se tournaient vers de petits m\xE9tiers ou des services.</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en>15.384</en><es>18.12</es><fr>15.344</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"1\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"True\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Aix\xF2 es va complir tant
      al llarg de la costa com a les muntanyes i a l\u2019interior, i les dones hi
      van tenir un paper molt actiu en aquesta economia familiar diversificada.</ca><en>This
      held true along the coast, in the mountains, and inland alike, and women played
      a very active role in this diversified family economy. </en><es>Esto se cumpli\xF3
      tanto a lo largo de la costa como en las monta\xF1as y en el interior, y las
      mujeres desempe\xF1aron un papel muy activo en esta econom\xEDa familiar diversificada.</es><fr>Cela
      s\u2019est v\xE9rifi\xE9 le long de la c\xF4te, dans les montagnes et \xE0
      l\u2019int\xE9rieur des terres, et les femmes ont jou\xE9 un r\xF4le tr\xE8s
      actif dans cette \xE9conomie familiale diversifi\xE9e.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text
      for language (ca)</ca><en>8.717</en><es>9.024</es><fr>9.24</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-4.263365,-0.4014624,4.651375\" rotation =
      \"0.1991126,-0.04958423,0.01008803,0.9786694\" scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\" type
      = \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/><asset name = \"Female_InnKeeper\" position
      = \"-5.21606,0.04612128,4.084687\" rotation = \"-0.01633019,0.8832328,-0.03084324,-0.4676343\"
      scale = \"0.1712037,0.1712037,0.1712037\" type = \"Model3D\" animation = \"Pick\"/><asset
      name = \"Male_Cook\" position = \"-5.089589,0.02681699,4.457256\" rotation
      = \"0.01919646,0.01045804,-0.0002008055,0.999761\" scale = \"0.1724844,0.1724844,0.1724844\"
      type = \"Model3D\" animation = \"Pointing\"/></token><token id = \"2\" audioclip
      = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\" destroy = \"False\"
      pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Tenir diverses fonts d\u2019ingressos era,
      de fet, una pr\xE0ctica habitual a la Catalunya rural.</ca><en>Having several
      sources of income was, in fact, common practice in rural Catalonia.</en><es>Tener
      varias fuentes de ingresos era, de hecho, una pr\xE1ctica habitual en la Catalu\xF1a
      rural.</es><fr>Avoir plusieurs sources de revenus \xE9tait, en fait, une pratique
      courante dans la Catalogne rurale.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text for language
      (ca)</ca><en>5.736</en><es>6.034</es><fr>5.016</fr></audios><asset name = \"Waypoint\"
      position = \"-5.433833,-0.6560527,4.058645\" rotation = \"0.2542666,-0.3135939,0.08755687,0.9106817\"
      scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\" type = \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/></token></narration><narration
      id = \"3\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" title=\"nothing\"><title id =
      \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\"><languages><ca>OCI
      AL CAMP</ca><en>LEISURE IN THE COUNTRYSIDE</en><es>OCIO EN EL CAMPO</es><fr>LOISIRS
      \xC0 LA CAMPAGNE</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en></en><es></es><fr></fr></audios></title><token
      id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Al camp, els festivals
      tenen un fort car\xE0cter religi\xF3s i comunitari, tot i que de vegades es
      prohibeixen per por de l\u2019alteraci\xF3 de l\u2019ordre.</ca><en>In the
      countryside, festivals have a strong religious and communal character, although
      they are sometimes banned out of fear of disorder.</en><es>En el campo, los
      festivales tienen un fuerte car\xE1cter religioso y comunitario, aunque a veces
      se proh\xEDben por miedo al desorden.</es><fr>\xC0 la campagne, les f\xEAtes
      ont un fort caract\xE8re religieux et communautaire, bien qu\u2019elles soient
      parfois interdites par crainte du d\xE9sordre.</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en>7.44</en><es>7.776</es><fr>7.656</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"1\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>En cada poble, la festa
      principal destaca, i consisteix en un servei religi\xF3s, un \xE0pat compartit
      i balls, alguns d\u2019origen medieval, com ara el \xABball de l\u2019almorratxa\xBB
      (el ball del c\xE0ntir).</ca><en>In each village, the main festival stands
      out, consisting of a religious service, a communal meal, and dances, some of
      medieval origin, such as the \xABball de l'almorratxa\xBB (the flask dance).
      </en><es>En cada pueblo, la fiesta principal destaca, y consiste en un servicio
      religioso, una comida comunitaria y bailes, algunos de origen medieval, como
      el \xABball de l'almorratxa\xBB (el baile del frasco).</es><fr>Dans chaque
      village, le festival principal se distingue, compos\xE9 d\u2019un office religieux,
      d\u2019un repas en commun et de danses, dont certaines d\u2019origine m\xE9di\xE9vale,
      comme la \xAB ball de l\u2019almorratxa \xBB (la danse de la gourde).</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text
      for language (ca)</ca><en>10.848</en><es>13.368</es><fr>12.312</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"sardana_0\" position = \"-3.58951,0.5473566,11.35891\" rotation =
      \"-0.04146817,-0.1390717,-0.005828853,0.9893966\" scale = \"3.466411,3.466411,3.466411\"
      type = \"Image\" animation = \"\"/><asset name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-2.563774,-0.2380332,10.66762\"
      rotation = \"0.1532945,0.1968939,-0.0311849,0.9678642\" scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\"
      type = \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/></token><token id = \"2\" audioclip
      = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\" destroy = \"False\"
      pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Les festes religioses inclouen processons,
      balls i jocs. El \xABRoser de Maig\xBB (Festival del Rosari) d\u2019Esplugues
      n\u2019\xE9s un exemple, que reflecteix una devoci\xF3 profunda entre la pagesia.</ca><en>Religious
      festivals include processions, dances, and games. The \xABRoser de Maig\xBB
      (Festival of the Rosary) in Esplugues is one such example, reflecting deep
      devotion among the peasantry.</en><es>Los festivales religiosos incluyen procesiones,
      danzas y juegos. El \xABRoser de Maig\xBB (Festival del Rosario) en Esplugues
      es un ejemplo de ello, que refleja una profunda devoci\xF3n entre la poblaci\xF3n
      campesina.</es><fr>Les f\xEAtes religieuses comprennent des processions, des
      danses et des jeux. Le \xAB Roser de Maig \xBB (F\xEAte du Rosaire) \xE0 Esplugues
      en est un exemple, refl\xE9tant une profonde d\xE9votion au sein de la paysannerie.</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text
      for language (ca)</ca><en>11.328</en><es>12.648</es><fr>11.286</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-4.487181,-0.3950307,10.33313\" rotation =
      \"0.185853,-0.3336888,0.06728344,0.9217285\" scale = \"0.2,0.2,0.2\" type =
      \"Waypoints\" animation = \"\"/></token></narration><narration id = \"4\" startEvent
      = \"\" endEvent = \"\" title=\"nothing\"><title id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\"
      startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\"><languages><ca>D\xC9U, P\xC0TRIA, REI I LLEIS</ca><en>GOD,
      HOMELAND, KING, AND LAWS</en><es>DIOS, PATRIA, REY Y LEYES</es><fr>Dieu, Patrie,
      Roi et Lois</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en></en><es></es><fr></fr></audios></title><token
      id = \"0\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"False\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Quan el rei Ferran VII
      mor, la lluita per la seva successi\xF3 enfronta els partidaris del seu germ\xE0,
      Carles Maria Isidre \u2014 els carlins, que afavoreixen el retorn a l\u2019absolutisme
      \u2014 contra els partidaris d\u2019Isabel II \u2014 els isabelins, que lluiten
      per consolidar la revoluci\xF3 liberal.</ca><en>When King Ferdinand VII dies,
      the struggle over his succession pits supporters of his brother, Carlos Mar\xEDa
      Isidro \u2014 the Carlists, who favor a return to absolutism \u2014 against
      supporters of Isabella II \u2014 the Isabelinos, who fight to consolidate the
      liberal revolution. </en><es>Cuando el rey Fernando VII muere, la lucha por
      su sucesi\xF3n enfrenta a los partidarios de su hermano, Carlos Mar\xEDa Isidro
      \u2014 los carlistas, que favorecen el retorno al absolutismo \u2014 contra
      los partidarios de Isabel II \u2014 los isabelinos, que luchan por consolidar
      la revoluci\xF3n liberal.</es><fr>Lorsque le roi Ferdinand VII meurt, la lutte
      pour sa succession oppose les partisans de son fr\xE8re, Carlos Mar\xEDa Isidro
      \u2014 les carlistes, qui souhaitent un retour \xE0 l\u2019absolutisme \u2014
      aux partisans d\u2019Isabelle II \u2014 les isabellins, qui combattent pour
      consolider la r\xE9volution lib\xE9rale.</fr></languages><audios><ca></ca><en>16.872</en><es>17.256</es><fr>15.984</fr></audios></token><token
      id = \"1\" audioclip = \"\" startEvent = \"\" endEvent = \"\" hide = \"False\"
      destroy = \"True\" pause = \"False\"><languages><ca>Tres guerres carlistes
      durant el segle XIX revelen aquesta profunda escletxa ideol\xF2gica</ca><en>Three
      Carlist Wars during the 19th century reveal this deep ideological rift</en><es>Tres
      guerras carlistas durante el siglo XIX revelan esta profunda fractura ideol\xF3gica</es><fr>Trois
      guerres carlistes au cours du XIXe si\xE8cle r\xE9v\xE8lent cette profonde
      fracture id\xE9ologique</fr></languages><audios><ca>Text for language (ca)</ca><en>5.568</en><es>5.64</es><fr>5.208</fr></audios><asset
      name = \"Waypoint\" position = \"-4.416575,-0.4841708,11.53008\" rotation =
